# Phase E2 — Beta Trust Improvements: VITE_PORTFOLIO_ENGINE=api is now the
# default in .env for the beta deployment (dev server), but the unit test
# suite deliberately exercises the code's own unset-flag default (legacy
# screen) as a real regression contract — see PortfolioScreen.test.jsx's
# "renders the legacy localStorage-driven screen by default". Vite loads
# .env.[mode] after .env for the same mode, so this override applies only
# when running tests (mode "test"), leaving the dev-server .env untouched.
VITE_PORTFOLIO_ENGINE=
